  setLiteral(11086, "Doppler: Off = no pitch change at all (the sound only moves in level, direction and room). Natural = the real pitch change (at walking speed in a room only a few cents). \303\227 3 / \303\227 6 / \303\227 12 = the pitch changes that many times more \342\200\223 a pass-by sounds like a car or a plane. The room sound comes a little later while it is on (the time shown)");
