  setLiteral(11127, "Starts again with every playback start and loop; free-running while stopped");
  setLiteral(11128, "Restarts at every playback start and with Start / Restart; loops run on smoothly");
  setLiteral(11129, "The positions are written to Source / Listener X, Y (and height) \342\200\223 record them in REAPER with Write or Latch; a read envelope on them overrides the pattern. Drag a moving ball = move its whole path");
